'''Eggies''' behave similarly to Hopper jumping around the room and chasing Isaac, spawning [[white creep]] wherever it jumps. When it takes enough damage, it spawns a group of {{e|Swarm Spider}}s. After dying its body remains for a few seconds where it can delay the room from being completed.
{{clear}}

=== Tainted Hopper ===
{{infobox monster
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Tainted Hopper
 | variant     = 3
 | base hp     = 80
 | environment = {{floor|Basement}}<br>Found on the [[Ascent]] to {{s|Home}}.
 | behavior    = Jumps and twirls around the room, shooting 4 rings of projectiles that increase in size with each shot.
}}

'''Tainted Hoppers''' are much stronger versions of Hoppers. They jump and twirl consecutively around the room, shooting 4 rings of projectiles, each increasing in size compared to the last. The first ring has 4 projectiles, the second has 6, the third has 8, and the last has 12.

They are exclusive to the [[Ascent]] to {{s|Home}}.
